 CJ, Flegal KM. Prevalence of overweight and obesity in the United States, 1999-2004. <source>JAMA</source><year>2006</year>;<volume>295</volume>:<fpage>1549</fpage>-55.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16595758</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref42"><label>42</label><citation citation-type="other">Van der Wilk EA. Prevalence of overweight (BMI 25-29.9) and obesity (BMI 30+) in European countries. 2008. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.euphix.org/object_document/o4620n27195.html">www.euphix.org/object_document/o4620n27195.html</ext-link></citation></ref></ref-list><notes notes-type="citation-text"><p><bold>Cite this as:</bold> <italic>BMJ</italic> 2008;337:a1440</p></notes></back></article>